        "name": "mkinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-16T07:25:46Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(import): open Solidcraft .sc designs as a model\n\nModel > Open, the viewport drop and MCP import_model now read a\nSolidcraft .sc design. The app calls the kernel reader\n(camcraft_kernel::solidcraft::import_solidcraft) for the cached final\nbody and meshes it with the machining mesh at the STEP chord cap\n(0.005 mm). Each kernel refusal is shown by name: \"Solidcraft design\nrefused: <reason>\". The new camcraft-app -> camcraft-kernel edge is\nnative only; the browser build does not offer .sc.\n\nPinned by crates/app/tests/import_solidcraft.rs and the file_drop unit\ntest a_solidcraft_design_drop_queues_the_import.\n\nFixes #1456\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
